  "help.title": "ADB Manager — keys",
  "help.body": "Tab / Shift+Tab · 1–6   switch tabs\n[ ]  D            previous / next device, device menu\n↑ ↓ PgUp PgDn     move in the current list · Enter opens actions\nr                 refresh   b  toggle device list   ?  help   q  quit\nW  P              Connect… / Pair…   K kill server\n\nOverview: s screenshot · i install APK · w Wi‑Fi debug · R reboot · t shell tab\nLogcat: p follow · l level · / text · c clear · S save · x clear filters · y copy line · m line menu\nPackages: / search · a all/3rd-party · m or Enter actions · i install\nFiles: Enter/→ open · Backspace/← up · g go to · u push · n new folder · Del delete · m menu\nShell: Enter run · k quick commands · . repeat · c clear\nForwards: f forward · v reverse · Del remove · m menu\n\nRight-click anywhere for a context menu. Hover a control to see what it does."
}
